# STM32CubeMX configuration reference
# MCU: STM32F103C8Tx
#
# Pin configuration used by the source files:
# PA0  = ADC1_IN0 (LM35 analog input)
# PA8  = GPIO_Output (LCD D6)
# PA9  = GPIO_Output (LCD D7)
# PA13 = SYS_SWDIO
# PA14 = SYS_SWCLK
# PB0  = GPIO_Output (Buzzer)
# PB1  = GPIO_Output (Alarm LED)
# PB12 = GPIO_Output (LCD RS)
# PB13 = GPIO_Output (LCD E)
# PB14 = GPIO_Output (LCD D4)
# PB15 = GPIO_Output (LCD D5)
#
# ADC1: 12-bit, single conversion, software trigger, right aligned,
# sampling time 71.5 cycles, channel 0.
#
# This file is a human-readable configuration reference. Recreate/import
# the MCU configuration in STM32CubeMX/CubeIDE if a fully generated
# .ioc format is required by your IDE version.
